  "question": {
    "text": "Uncertainity in position of a minute particle of mass $25 \\mathrm{~g}$ in space is $10^{-5} \\mathrm{~m}$. What is the uncertainity in its velocity (in $\\left.\\mathrm{ms}^{-1}\\right) ?\\left(\\mathrm{~h}=6.6 \\times 10^{-34} \\mathrm{Js}\\right)$"
  },
